         (< army-supply 14)
         (< minerals 400)))
  ;; L39-P0-2c + L41-P0-2a + L47-P0-2a + L59C (`#1566` Fix #3):
  ;; Keep 2-base RoboticsBay after 3rd Nexus / 2nd Robo / `>= 6:00` (`8064f`), unless confirmed
