  ;; L42-P0-2c + L47-P0-2a (`H2H #04 PvT` / `#21` / `PvP 0-7` Colossus #1/#2 300M/200G escrow lock):
  ;; Once RoboticsBay is ready and Colossus < 2 across PvT/PvZ/PvP, reserve 300M/200G for Colossus (`u >= 760.0, blk = #t`)
